      "reason": "Guide diagnosis before changing the backbone and avoid attributing a correctness repair to adaptive retention.",
      "query": "For PyTorch GRU recommenders with left-padded histories, how should execution tests isolate final-state discrepancies when aligned valid outputs match but final readouts differ by 1e-4 to 6e-4? Cover greatest-nonpadding-index gathering, empty histories, output versus hidden-state semantics, evaluation-mode dropout, and batched versus individual numerical differences without relaxing tolerances."
