      "reason": "Assess implementation cost and define an interpretable experiment within the fixed training budget.",
      "query": "What implementation and ablation practices allow a coordinate-wise pre-update retention gate in a multilayer GRU recommender to be compared fairly with a padding-correct baseline? Cover direct item-embedding conditioning at every layer, preserving dropout and loss semantics, custom GRUCell versus fused GRU throughput, and gate saturation and history-length diagnostics using one trained checkpoint per category."
